 "title": "Pricing - Starter & Professional Plans | Scalio",
 "meta_description": "Compare Starter and Professional: 60 or 200 creative credits, Calendar allowances, team seats, websites, AI replies and Google Growth.",
 "text": "Skip to main content\nFeatures\nExamples\nBlog\nPricing\nContact\nUse on web\nGet the app\nSTARTER & PROFESSIONAL\nThe right plan for your next step.\n\nShow up on social every day with Starter. Choose Professional for more content, a website for your business, and AI replies that keep customers engaged.\n\nSTARTER\n\nShow up on social, every day.\n\n\u20b9999\nper month\n\n60 creative credits / month\n\nFor 1 team member\n\nKEEP YOUR SOCIAL MEDIA ACTIVE\n\nA full month of social media posting\n10 stories to keep your audience engaged\nRoom to edit and try new versions\nYour creative credits are included on top\nReels, AI actors, posts and photoshoots\nContent made for your business and brand\nAdd-on creative credits available\nA website for your business\nAI replies to customer messages\nGoogle Business Profile tools\nAI Marketing\nChoose Starter\nMORE FOR YOUR BUSINESS\nPROFESSIONAL\n\nCreate more. Reply faster. Grow online.\n\n\u20b91,999\nper month\n\n200 creative credits / month\n\nFor up to 5 team members\n\nKEEP YOUR SOCIAL MEDIA ACTIVE\n\nA full month of social media posting\n25 stories to keep your audience engaged\nRoom to edit and try new versions\nYour creative credits are included on top\nReels, AI actors, posts and photoshoots\nA website for your business\nAI replies to customer messages\nGrow on Google \u00b7 up to 5 locations\nAI Marketing \u00b7 coming soon\nAdd-on creative credits available\nChoose Professional\nWhat each paid plan includes\nWhat you get\tStarter\tProfessional\nCreative credits\t60 / month\t200 / month\nSocial media posting\tA full month \u00b7 30 posts\tA full month \u00b7 30 posts\nSocial media stories\t10 / month\t25 / month\nTeam members\t1\t5\nWebsite Builder\tNot included\t1 website\nAI customer replies\tNot included\tIncluded\nGoogle Business Profile tools\tNot included\tUp to 5 locations\nAI Marketing\tNot included\tComing soon\n\nYour full month of posting includes 30 social posts. Stories, new versions and edits have separate monthly limits, so your creative credits can go towards more Reels, photoshoots and other content. AI replies are subject to a monthly usage allowance.\n\nBilled monthly. Final pricing, taxes and available offers are shown at checkout. You can set up your business before choosing a paid plan.\n\nINCLUDED IN EVERY PAID PLAN\nAI trained on your business + brand\n\nScalio learns your products, audience, style, and tone during setup. After that, your content starts from your brand context instead of a blank prompt box.\n\nCREATIVE TOOLS IN BOTH PLANS\n\nMake content for your brand.\nNo prompting needed\nAI Social Media Calendar\n\u2192\nReel Maker\n\u2192\nAI Actor\n\u2192\nPost Maker\n\u2192\nFashion Photoshoot Studio\n\u2192\nProduct Photoshoot Studio\n\u2192\nHOW CREDITS WORK\nDaily posts, plus room to create more.\n\nYour monthly social posts and stories are included. Use your creative credits for extra Reels, photoshoots and other content.\n\nCREATIVE CREDITS\n\n60 or 200\n\nYour monthly credits for Reels, AI actors, images and photoshoots. Credit cost depends on the tool and settings.\n\nSOCIAL MEDIA POSTING\n\nA full month\n\n30 posts to keep your business showing up. Included in both plans, separately from your creative credits.\n\nSOCIAL MEDIA STORIES\n\n10 or 25\n\nStarter includes 10 stories per month. Professional includes 25.\n\nMORE WHEN YOU NEED IT\n\nAdd-on credits\n\nBuy extra creative credits in the app. Review the credit cost before you create.\n\nAdd-on creative credits are available in the app. Check the current pack sizes and prices before you buy.\n\nNEED MORE VOLUME?\n\nFind the right plan for your business.\nTalk to us\n\nRun marketing 24/7.\nPosts, Reels, ads and replies\u2014handled by Scalio, even when you\u2019re offline.\n\n4.8 ON APP STORE & PLAY\nUSE CASES\nAI Background Change\nAI Background Removal\nBulk Product Photography AI\nD2C Product Photography\nAI Image Upscaling\nUGC Product Ads Creation\nBoutique Product Photography\nExplore all \u2192\nAI MARKETING\nExamples\nAI Photoshoot\nAI Ad Maker\nWhatsApp Marketing\nFestival Poster Maker\nInstagram Reel Maker\nSmall Business Marketing\nBest AI Social Tools\nExplore all \u2192\nGARMENTS\nSaree Product Photography\nDress Product Photography\nKurta Product Photography\nLehenga Product Photography\nShirt Product Photography\nJeans Product Photography\nJacket Product Photography\nExplore all \u2192\nMARKETPLACES\nAmazon Product Photography\nFlipkart Product Photography\nMyntra Fashion Photography\nShopify Product Photography\nInstagram Product Photography\nFacebook Shop Photography\nNykaa Fashion Photography\nExplore all \u2192\nAD PLATFORMS\nFacebook Ad Creatives\nInstagram Ad Creatives\nGoogle Display Ads\nTikTok Ad Creatives\nPinterest Ad Creatives\nLinkedIn Sponsored Ads\nYouTube Ad Creatives\nExplore all \u2192\nINDUSTRIES\nE-commerce Product Photography\nFashion Brand Photography\nBeauty Product Photography\nJewelry Product Photography\nRetail Product Photography\nFashion Campaign Photography\nHome Decor Product Photography\nExplore all \u2192\nPRODUCTS\nProduct Carousel Ads\nProduct Social Media Content\nProduct Website Images\nProduct Static Image Ads for Facebook\nProduct Photos for Landing Pages\nSeasonal Product Photography\nEditorial Fashion Photography\nExplore all \u2192\nVERSUS\nScalio vs ChatGPT\nScalio vs Canva\nScalio vs Getayna\nAI vs Hiring Photographer\nScalio vs PhotoRoom\nAI vs Traditional Photography\nScalio vs Botika\nScalio vs Gemini\nExplore all \u2192\nBY BUSINESS\nRestaurant Social Media\nFitness Social Media\nReal Estate Social Media\nAI Content Calendar\nVirtual Try-On Clothes\nCONTACT\nsupport@scalio.app\nScalio Technology Private Limited\nK-2035 CR Park, New Delhi\n\n\u00a9 2026 Scalio. Made with \u2665 in India.\n\nBlog\nDocs\nAPI\nAffiliates\nBrand\nPrivacy\nTerms\nRefund\nAcceptable use",
